## Get Lyrics by Track

```http
GET /tracks/:id/lyrics?variant=synced
```

Returns parsed lines of synchronized LRC lyrics for timed audio playback in clients.

### Query Parameters

| Parameter | Type | Default | Options | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `variant` | string | `original` | `original`, `synced`, `translated`, `romanized` | Variant of lyrics to fetch |

### Response (`200 OK`)

```json
{
  "variant": "synced",
  "synced": true,
  "lines": [
    {
      "time": 12.4,
      "text": "Di suatu malam yang sunyi..."
    },
    {
      "time": 16.8,
      "text": "Kuteringat kata-katamu..."
    },
    {
      "time": 22.1,
      "text": "Yang selalu membuatku tersenyum..."
    },
    {
      "time": 28.5,
      "text": "Jatuh suka pada tatapan pertama..."
    }
  ]
}
```

---

## Add Lyric Variant (Master Only)

```http
POST /tracks/:id/lyrics
```

### Headers

- `X-Master-Key`: `<your_master_secret>`
- `Content-Type`: `application/json`

### Request Body

```json
{
  "language": "id",
  "variant": "synced",
  "content": "[00:12.40] Di suatu malam yang sunyi...\n[00:16.80] Kuteringat kata-katamu...\n[00:22.10] Yang selalu membuatku tersenyum...\n[00:28.50] Jatuh suka pada tatapan pertama..."
}
```

### Response (`201 Created`)

```json
{
  "id": "lyr_9f8e7d",
  "track_id": "trk_7f9a2b1c",
  "variant": "synced",
  "synced": true
}
```
